    // message moves it (`updateSessionMessageActivityProjection`), so this index is maintained on
    // the hottest write in the product. Measured per 2,000-row activity burst: +135 bytes of WAL per
    // row on PostgreSQL (+6.7% over the same burst without it), +0.9% WAL pages on SQLite, ~+13%
